    <itunes:duration>00:43:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqKB4X5iqa4_CSAP8o6LWervKZrS.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.33 探秘约旦：玫瑰之城佩特拉与死海密语</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69519aac2db086f897749372</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69519aac2db086f897749372</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Dec 2025 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从新闻标题中走出的约旦，究竟是什么样子？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，Tina将带领我们穿越时间与想象，深入连接这片文明层叠的旅行秘境。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，玫瑰色的佩特拉神殿在落日下低语，死海的盐度托起轻盈的身体，安曼街角的涂鸦与罗马剧场并肩而立——约旦，远比我们以为的更复杂、鲜活，也更具包容性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>夜晚的佩特拉和白天有何不同？是否值得两次打卡？</span></p><span></span><p><span>死海漂浮都有哪些注意事项？</span></p><span></span><p><span>约旦旅行都有哪些值得解锁的美食？</span></p><span></span><p><span>......</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起揭开约旦的神秘面纱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>旅行有时候并不是为了“去多远”，而是为了走近那些原本被误解、被标签化的地方。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这一期也能勾起你更多对于约旦的好奇，破开想象和传言的迷雾，在未来的某一天，亲身站在佩特拉的山崖前，或者漂浮在死海的碧蓝上。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025年就和大家聊到这里啦，我们2026再见！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk7Mw5dGPx2CAv5yeStoFw6LpFKN.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>佩特拉蛇道处看卡兹尼神殿（又称宝库）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FilXXtgKG4ZpxPh23nInPzZZOoYf.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsX3OISMgoR-P8WhAKHcNEWaztTi.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>佩特拉夜色</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr5yoj02fwGhx7IYsE8u3p2fux-g.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>死海</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lroWFx43mJw4y1X1dZvtu4eVuLol.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>约旦首都安曼街头涂鸦</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：Tina （XHS：我也不知道起什么名字好）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/A01zg1COxjJ" href="https://xhslink.com/m/A01zg1COxjJ">xhslink.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>更多约旦攻略可移步嘉宾社交媒体</span></p><span></span><p><span>来自嘉宾的温馨提示👇</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 约旦通Jordan Pass，一票通的概念，含约旦签证费及多处重要景点门票费 <a data-url="https://jordanpass.jo" href="https://jordanpass.jo">jordanpass.jo</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 安曼高级餐厅 - Fakhreldin 前约旦高管官邸转型为黎巴嫩餐厅，<a data-url="https://maps.app.goo.gl/ArFGG9Ta2XQvnmaf9?g_st=ipc" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/ArFGG9Ta2XQvnmaf9?g_st=ipc">maps.app.goo.gl</a> 推荐炸鸡肉球（爆浆），蘑菇羊肉馅饼（浓郁），蒜酱（奶香配馕）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgW5kJ1oN5w3ne241geCJrRtT4ji.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtD7VeopCW7M5Of2vJmmHas8S5Se.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>3. 安曼连锁炸鸡店 - Crispy Chicken 外酥里嫩多汁&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhNgNyc3cEm2vRj1XDs5mApM-Qw1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 正篇开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> 约旦并不像想象般保守</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 约旦旅行是否有必要购入“约旦通”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 佩特拉之旅让人想到《桃花源记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 在死海上看报纸是怎样一种体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a> 舌尖上的约旦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1701">28:21</a> 约旦行程规划参考</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64edaa3f47ee3ea1af864bbe/lhGeEx74LpZWxFiIMHkELDINC-At.m4a" length="33350233" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqKB4X5iqa4_CSAP8o6LWervKZrS.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.32 上山下海 打开阿联酋的另一种可能</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69431139c4f10bdeeaf1219a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69431139c4f10bdeeaf1219a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Dec 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>提到阿联酋，您首先想到的是高耸入云的哈利法塔、奢华的购物中心，还是填海造陆的人工奇迹？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，我们将暂别各种人造奇观，一起去往更广阔的天地——</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟随资深旅行家 Luke 深入波斯湾的蔚蓝秘境，翻开阿联酋的“地质史书”，重新发现一个山脉与海洋交响、传统与现代共存的折叠国度。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期里，你将听到各种阿联酋的自然乐章。一起上山下海，打开阿联酋的另一种可能。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loJ3NzOt5Y7e1jffIcWCLo9QVDSW.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>哈塔水库</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgeQge1gTCe3e3trNsQs87IWgAPL.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“法拉吉”灌溉系统</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhGYGqwz-iL9NBDj9gs_fkaFeoAK.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>富查伊拉潜水</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQyX2a3EKkbUK206BYpxQvZp0M6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liomkPrzmM9o2F6gFLMnclnzL19l.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>地貌构造</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：Luke （小红书：Luke）</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 正篇开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 人造天堂vs自然乐章 破除对阿联酋的刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> 自然与人文的对话：从博物馆看阿联酋的蜕变逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 为什么一定来到阿联酋要选择自驾游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1409">23:29</a> 上山：翻开阿联酋的“地质史书”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 入地：下降16米 探秘古阿拉伯人的灌溉系统&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 哈塔冬季节：集中感受阿拉伯风情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a>下海：潜入阿曼湾——超丰富的海洋生物</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目中提到的地点：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hatta 露营爬山骑车吃饭的地点↓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://maps.app.goo.gl/mTATJsufRXTVKFc68" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/mTATJsufRXTVKFc68">maps.app.goo.gl</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>Khor Fakkan 有人工瀑布、剧院和老城的城市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://maps.app.goo.gl/Ard7AbUXYRcsMrA36" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/Ard7AbUXYRcsMrA36">maps.app.goo.gl</a></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64edaa3f47ee3ea1af864bbe/luwbA5KfTZmdCp9C0BTWIG0XoCOB.m4a" length="49508047" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqKB4X5iqa4_CSAP8o6LWervKZrS.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.31 从大埃及博物馆 开启中东博物馆狂喜之旅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693aafdc37f52a644e67ead4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">693aafdc37f52a644e67ead4</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 11:55:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>转眼，2025就剩最后一个月。在岁末之际，相继打卡了三座博物馆对公众开放的第一天，再一次感受到这片神奇的土地的文化魅力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大埃及博物馆2025年11月4日对公众开放</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿布扎比自然历史博物馆2025年11月28日对公众开放</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿联酋扎耶德国家博物馆2025年12月3日对公众开放</span></p><span></span><p><span>对于博物馆爱好者而言，今年是当之无愧的狂喜之年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在2025年年末之际，就让我们一起走过这三座新近开放的博物馆，</span></p><span></span><p><span>去大埃及博物馆里，感受法老文明的磅礴新生；</span></p><span></span><p><span>去阿布扎比自然历史博物馆，穿梭“时空隧道”，回望地球史诗；</span></p><span></span><p><span>去阿布扎比扎耶德国家博物馆，触摸阿联酋从沙漠到星辰的现代化脉搏</span></p><span></span><p><span>走起！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpJXqZ2Dw5rcIQL_Bv8EblD-4bly.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>阿联酋扎耶德博物馆夜色</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlJNMsEH0oY6iN0aZg-FeV4gqDoe.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>图坦卡蒙黄金面具</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fid4KbwRzFZlUOfWY4YpAZOBbvgS.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>甩发舞</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmAXVZa1T1rxx85Sval64XZ_PwCt.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>阿联酋扎耶德博物馆</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvxhXUtN4Z1egW2j1ARiAc7Aj8XF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkDghK_if6xu5fA1erwLGEO9520D.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>阿布扎比自然历史博物馆</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">01:51</a> 大埃及博物馆开幕盛宴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="517">08:37</a> 探秘大埃及博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 走进阿布扎比自然历史博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 阿联酋扎耶德博物馆</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64edaa3f47ee3ea1af864bbe/lsYEWPF3IcgJTlNs9cXQSpCYngTR.m4a" length="37963813" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqKB4X5iqa4_CSAP8o6LWervKZrS.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 30 二刷埃及 停火博弈、防骗魔法与隐藏神迹</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6902886e7f1b08483a4fc462</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6902886e7f1b08483a4fc462</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Oct 2025 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>休了个长假后的失踪人口回归，继续和大家聊聊埃及。</span></p><span></span><p><span>塞穆尔·约翰逊那句“如果你厌倦了伦敦，你也就厌倦了生活”，在我看来，放在埃及显得更加贴切，她丰富多彩，也磨人刺激；她慷慨馈赠，也考验勇气；她混乱喧嚣，也深邃宁静......她会让你骂骂咧咧，却也让你无法忘记。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期前半部分和大家聊聊巴以局势的最新进展，埃及作为斡旋方的一些作为。</span></p><span></span><p><span>后半部分聊聊此行埃及的见闻，给大家呈上一个非常实用的“埃及防骗指南”，以及一些相对小众的景点推荐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线在此👇 方便大家根据兴趣自行跳转：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场与近况更新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> 出发背景：沙姆沙伊赫和平峰会与巴以局势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 走访埃及救援组织</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a> 对话埃及前外交部副部长 埃及如何看待巴以局势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a> 埃及作为斡旋方的影响力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a> 如果你厌倦了埃及，你也就厌倦了生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 开罗防骗指南：骑骆驼的“魔法”与应对技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">21:16</a> 开罗小众景点推荐一：坦努拉舞（旋转舞）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 小众推荐二：垃圾城深处的洞穴教堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1883">31:23</a> 二刷埃及 她让你骂骂咧咧，却也念念不忘</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljfMO8keYJsctm6GwfUME3VcgF-C.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>洞穴教堂外景</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lo2dNlWkFJOogjwzMSioSlIyapps.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>洞穴教堂内景</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsHn_imP1LS9_Bww_LwtT-q9W4aH.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>洞穴教堂内景</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgfKNpSay8nYw_HqHEFIexTWZEWq.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>新开罗U Venus&nbsp;</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64edaa3f47ee3ea1af864bbe/ltf9k-RJ-Vx2OjHsPLbC7k3jrQOK.m4a" length="51195378" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqKB4X5iqa4_CSAP8o6LWervKZrS.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 29 卓见中东两周年 &amp; 巴林48小时里的树与公主</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68947160638b0158796f37ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68947160638b0158796f37ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Aug 2025 09:46:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一转眼就到了驻外两周年也是这档播客两周年的纪念日，两年终于想明白想要透过这档播客实现什么。</span></p><span></span><p><span>固然不指望一档播客就去改变根深蒂固的刻板印象；但所谓意义，是希望让中文世界多一扇窗，照见中东地区冲突与诗意并存的日常。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期后半部分是中东地区最小的国家——巴林的旅程分享，带你一起去感受这个迷你又厚重的海湾岛国的多样。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从沙漠中的“生命树”、第一口油井的工业记忆，到偶遇王室公主的跨文化对话，再到千年文明的“两海之地”如何成为沙特的“后花园”，聊聊48小时内的见闻，以及对于巴林的第一印象。</span></p><span></span><p><span>您对于中东地区还有哪些好奇之处，欢迎在评论区留言。我们下期再见！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjCebslr65yoGBp8jGR9Wcq3R95z.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>巴林“生命之树”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsfiJWzZZDVB7xvAXRgqvg1FUZba.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>遇到一个超可爱的油井</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhOigyyd3f5BBhZvqu7XLp1Ugu6O.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>巴林堡遗址</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo71BeiDxtQGlqgsGafPogqYO-ud.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>巴林世界贸易中心</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>时间线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 「卓见中东」两周年小总结 终于想清楚做这档播客的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1043">17:23</a> 巴林初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">17:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a> “三件套”打卡 巴林“生命之树”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1376">22:56</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">23:55</a> 海湾第一口油井</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> &nbsp;一座跨海大桥 为何让巴林成为沙特的“后花园”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> 与巴林公主的奇遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2091">34:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> 被低估的文明厚度 巴林的世界遗产——巴林堡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2276">37:56</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2486">41:26</a> 现代化中的巴林</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64edaa3f47ee3ea1af864bbe/ljdDnWq-AFAG_HO1uAAxBmAiu3XF.m4a" length="60276473" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoTi_AWl_j9tRuqs-0ZzTvmM8t05.png"/>
